    "updated_at": "2026-11-17T21:34:51Z",
    "body": "Decision by the maintainer (question dialog, 2026-11-17): \"GitHub issue in browser\".\n\n- Send opens a new GitHub issue of this repository in the browser. The type, the title, the description and the program version are filled in.\n- The program uploads nothing. It saves the screenshot and the log to a folder, opens that folder, and tells the user to drag the files into the issue.\n- The project file is included only when the user sets the check box. It is then copied to the same folder, not uploaded.\n- The program stores no account data.\n\nThe open question of the comment before this one is closed.\n",
